:SumOfNetPricesEqualsInvoiceAmountConstraint a :SHACLConstraint ;
    rdfs:label "Sum of Net Prices Equals Invoice Amount Constraint" ;
    rdfs:comment "A SHACL constraint stating that the sum of net prices for all line items in an invoice must equal the invoice total amount (per EN 16931)." .

